      "message": "This placement is a bit different than what I was suggesting. During `bio_wash --factory_init`, we call [`InitEntropy()`](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform2/biod/tools/bio_wash.cc;l\u003d42;drc\u003dc65a5e685b0c9676cd00f140c5a0017a55d6e3b0), which ultimately sends the `EC_CMD_ADD_ENTROPY` command to the FPMCU, which is handled [here](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/common/rollback.c;l\u003d448-472;drc\u003d91be0dcf45a0be7a630e2ee21ccabb5d739187e2). That is what I was thinking about when you asked about the `bio_wash --factory_init` path, and I think is also what Patryk is referring to. \n\nBefore we go much farther with this CL, let\u0027s go ahead and write the design doc and share with the team so that we can make sure we\u0027re all in agreement and will have a reference for the future when questions come up.",
